Here is a complete, self-contained HTML5 Snake game. You can save this code as an `.html` file (e.g., `snake.html`) and open it in any modern web browser.

### Features:
- **Classic Gameplay**: Eat food to grow, avoid walls and yourself.
- **Controls**: Arrow keys or WASD.
- **Score Tracking**: Current score and high score (stored in `localStorage`).
- **Game States**: Start screen, Game Over screen, and Pause functionality.
- **Responsive Design**: Works on desktop and mobile (with on-screen buttons for mobile).

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>HTML5 Snake Game</title>
    <style>
        body {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            background-color: #2c3e50;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            color: #ecf0f1;
            margin: 0;
        }

        h1 {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            color: #2ecc71;
        }

        .game-container {
            position: relative;
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
            border-radius: 8px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        canvas {
            background-color: #34495e;
            display: block;
        }

        .score-board {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            width: 400px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-size: 1.2em;
        }

        .controls {
            margin-top: 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .mobile-controls {
            display: none;
            margin-top: 20px;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 10px;
            width: 200px;
        }

        .mobile-btn {
            background-color: #34495e;
            border: none;
            color: white;
            padding: 15px;
            font-size: 20px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            cursor: pointer;
            user-select: none;
        }

        .mobile-btn:active {
            background-color: #2ecc71;
        }

        .overlay {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            display: none; /* Hidden by default */
        }

        .overlay.active {
            display: flex;
        }

        .overlay h2 {
            color: #e74c3c;
            font-size: 2em;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .overlay p {
            font-size: 1.2em;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .btn {
            background-color: #2ecc71;
            color: white;
            border: none;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            font-size: 1.2em;
            border-radius: 5px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background 0.3s;
        }

        .btn:hover {
            background-color: #27ae60;
        }

        /* Show mobile controls on small screens */
        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .mobile-controls {
                display: grid;
            }
            .game-container {
                width: 90vw;
                height: 90vw;
            }
            canvas {
                width: 100%;
                height: 100%;
            }
        }
    </style>
